{"title": "Sublimate of Tongue of Madness", "pageid": 14845, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness", "categories": ["Alchemical extracts", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Icon.png/300px-Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/bf/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Sublimate of Tongue of Madness image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Icon.png/300px-Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sublimate of Tongue of Madness</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Extraction</a>. It can be combined with any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Essence</a> to create <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tadpole_Elixir\" title=\"Tadpole Elixir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Ico